{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受明显不如X细腻，尤其是音色、节奏、力度、声部变化与情绪之间的具体联系被压缩了，部分细微的心理转折也失去了层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左侧叙述连续、自然，右侧感受独立成组，观众可以先抓住人物正在经历什么，再用短词补充当下的情绪，比较容易边听边扫，也容易理解人物为什么反复动摇。X的音乐感受更丰富，尤其能呈现情绪和音乐细节在时间中的变化，但信息交替较密，容易让观众忙于接收局部描述而忽略故事主线。综合普通观众的实际观看体验，我选Y，但X在感受的细腻程度上有明显优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "08ae69ae-b316-4082-b0b8-8007e907bba6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T184355848797Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:45:14.500398+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3697a3a8b82f63e364a5deada197e8b2d4cdffc7002163b55529526b4470a85a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at